WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.649
(group chanting)

00:00:01.649 --> 00:00:03.090
(foreign language)

00:00:03.090 --> 00:00:05.370
- [Host] After President
Vladimir Putin mobilized

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:08.160
ordinary Russians to fight
in UKRAINE in September,

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:10.380
large protests broke out.

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:13.214
Families more in conscripts
who died on the front lines

00:00:13.214 --> 00:00:16.383
and hundreds of thousands of
RUSSIAN men fled the country.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:18.900
But these aren't the images that Russians

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:20.766
are seeing on state media.

00:00:20.766 --> 00:00:23.100
(foreign language)

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:26.040
National television showed
the president firing a rifle

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:29.040
and inspecting RESERVIST
who looked all set to fight

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:30.720
and citizens say on air,

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:33.266
they're fully prepared for combat.

00:00:33.266 --> 00:00:35.130
(foreign language)

00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:38.100
As Putin faces a backlash
against the MOBILIZATION,

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:40.740
here's how the state PROPAGANDA
machine has stepped in

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:42.723
to try to reassure the population.

00:00:43.627 --> 00:00:46.544
(foreign language)

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:52.020
When the MOBILIZATION was
announced, STATE TV reported

00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:54.300
that men were flocking to
recruitment centers out

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:57.030
of patriotism, and it
showed smiling families

00:00:57.030 --> 00:00:59.160
sending their loved ones to war.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:02.040
The RUSSIAN army said it was
drafting ordinary citizens

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:04.170
to help hold the front lines in UKRAINE

00:01:04.170 --> 00:01:06.630
and anchors said the population responded

00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:08.575
with a wave of support.

00:01:08.575 --> 00:01:10.590
(foreign language)

00:01:10.590 --> 00:01:11.730
Those reports came

00:01:11.730 --> 00:01:14.160
as recruitment centers were
being targeted by a series

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:17.458
of attacks and polls showed
growing anxiety among Russians.

00:01:17.458 --> 00:01:20.220
According to an independent
pollster, the number

00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:22.620
of Russians who think that the
campaigning UKRAINE is going

00:01:22.620 --> 00:01:27.093
as planned dropped to 53% in
September from 73% in May.

00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:30.840
Days after announcing the
MOBILIZATION, Putin admitted

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:33.065
that the way the DRAFT was
managed raised many questions.

00:01:33.065 --> 00:01:35.982
(foreign language)

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:42.780
But in October, the KREMLIN
start to face criticism

00:01:42.780 --> 00:01:44.610
as new recruits started on the front lines

00:01:44.610 --> 00:01:46.440
just days after being summoned.

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:47.385
Some families say they
were poorly trained.

00:01:47.385 --> 00:01:50.385
(foreign language)

00:01:54.630 --> 00:01:57.300
New recruits also complained
about equipment shortages

00:01:57.300 --> 00:01:58.680
saying they had to buy things such

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:01.642
as flashlights or sleeping bags themselves

00:02:01.642 --> 00:02:04.642
(foreign language)

00:02:16.735 --> 00:02:18.930
So news reports start
to regularly cover those

00:02:18.930 --> 00:02:21.780
themes mobilize men going
through battle drills

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:23.670
dressed in mint condition uniforms

00:02:23.670 --> 00:02:26.070
and equipped with all the
gear needed for combat,

00:02:26.070 --> 00:02:29.214
helmets, bulletproof
vests, and sleeping bags.

00:02:29.214 --> 00:02:32.297
(foreign language)

00:02:34.470 --> 00:02:36.180
And the president himself went on camera

00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:38.913
and gave a word of encouragement
to the new draftees.

00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:44.742
(bomb exploding)

00:02:44.742 --> 00:02:47.742
(foreign language)

00:02:48.907 --> 00:02:51.480
It's hard to tell how effective
the state PROPAGANDA is.

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:52.860
According to Border Authorities

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:54.931
in Europe and other countries,

00:02:54.931 --> 00:02:56.910
more than 300,000 Russians
have left the territory

00:02:56.910 --> 00:02:58.230
since late September.

00:02:58.230 --> 00:03:00.627
Many say they fled to
avoid being sent to war.

00:03:00.627 --> 00:03:04.320
Still, many Russians express
strong support for the INVASION

00:03:04.320 --> 00:03:07.068
of UKRAINE and are not
averse to the MOBILIZATION.

00:03:07.068 --> 00:03:10.068
(foreign language)

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:20.190
The KREMLIN said that even
though there were problems

00:03:20.190 --> 00:03:21.120
with the MOBILIZATION

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:23.280
the situation shouldn't be generalized.

00:03:23.280 --> 00:03:25.290
According to Putin, reservists can be sent

00:03:25.290 --> 00:03:28.113
to the front lines after
10 to 25 days of training.

00:03:29.310 --> 00:03:30.990
In late October, handout footage

00:03:30.990 --> 00:03:32.580
from the RUSSIAN
government showed Russia's

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:35.280
Minister of Defense telling
Putin that the MOBILIZATION

00:03:35.280 --> 00:03:39.720
was successfully concluding
with some 300,000 men drafted.

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:42.480
However, many Russians
say they are skeptical.

00:03:42.480 --> 00:03:44.610
The President didn't
sign an official decree

00:03:44.610 --> 00:03:47.610
to end the DRAFT saying
it wasn't necessary.

00:03:47.610 --> 00:03:49.050
This has fueled concerns

00:03:49.050 --> 00:03:51.420
that the MOBILIZATION
could resume at any moment

00:03:51.420 --> 00:03:54.363
as RUSSIA continues to
suffer setbacks in UKRAINE.

00:03:54.363 --> 00:03:57.030
(upbeat music)

